sequenceDiagram
    participant "Backend Service (ASP.NET Core)" as BackendServiceASPNETCore
    participant "Audit Events Queue" as AuditEventsQueue
    participant "Audit Processor" as AuditProcessor
    participant "Immutable Audit Store" as ImmutableAuditStore
    participant "Audit Events DLQ" as AuditEventsDLQ

    activate BackendServiceASPNETCore
    BackendServiceASPNETCore->>BackendServiceASPNETCore: 1. 1. Process user request (e.g., successful login)
    BackendServiceASPNETCore-->>BackendServiceASPNETCore: Generates audit event context
    BackendServiceASPNETCore->>AuditEventsQueue: 2. 2. SendMessageAsync(auditEvent)
    AuditEventsQueue-->>BackendServiceASPNETCore: MessageId, MD5OfMessageBody
    BackendServiceASPNETCore->>BackendServiceASPNETCore: 3. 3. Return successful response to user
    activate AuditProcessor
    AuditEventsQueue->>AuditProcessor: 4. 4. [Async] Invoke with SQS message batch
    AuditProcessor->>AuditProcessor: 5. 5. For each message: validate event schema
    AuditProcessor-->>AuditProcessor: Valid/Invalid
    AuditProcessor->>ImmutableAuditStore: 6. 6. PutObjectAsync(validatedEvent)
    ImmutableAuditStore-->>AuditProcessor: ETag, VersionId
    AuditProcessor->>AuditEventsQueue: 7. 7. [On Success] Delete message from queue
    AuditEventsQueue-->>AuditProcessor: Success confirmation
    AuditProcessor->>AuditEventsDLQ: 8. 8. [On Failure] Move message to DLQ

    note over ImmutableAuditStore: Immutability is enforced by S3 Object Lock in 'COMPLIANCE' mode, preventing deletion or modificat...
    note over AuditEventsDLQ: A CloudWatch Alarm must be configured on ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible for the DLQ. A value ...

    deactivate AuditProcessor
    deactivate BackendServiceASPNETCore
